"reading-usb-speed-labels":{"description":{"zh":"先换算线速并看两头谈成哪档，再找链条上最窄的一段，最后看它走 USB 桥接还是 PCIe 隧道。","en":"Convert the name to a line rate and check what both ends negotiate, find the narrowest stage, and ask whether it goes through a USB bridge or a PCIe tunnel."},"source":"../computing/systems/how-usb-drives-talk/#ch11","lessons":[{"slug":"how-usb-drives-talk","step":null,"anchor":"ch11","category":"computing","stage":"university","primary":true}],"aliases":{"zh":["移动硬盘参数怎么看","USB 速度标识怎么看","硬盘盒规格怎么看"],"en":["how to read USB speed labels","external drive spec sheet","what to check on a USB enclosure box"]}}
